  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ピクニック用の　水筒として　定番の商品。シンプルなデザインで　持ち運びやすく男女問わず　選ぶ人が　多い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "피크닉용 보틀의 정석 같은 상품. 심플한 디자인에 휴대가 간편해서 남녀 불문하고 고르는 사람이 많다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "國民款的野餐用水壺。設計簡潔，且容易攜帶，因此不分男女廣受青睞。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une gourde largement utilisée lors de pique-niques. Sa forme simple et pratique la rend populaire auprès d’un large public.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieser Klassiker unter den Picknickflaschen lässt sich leicht transportieren und besticht durch sein schlichtes Design. Deshalb ist diese Flasche allseits beliebt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El típico termo para pícnic, con un diseño sencillo y práctico que agrada a todo el mundo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Classica borraccia da picnic. Il suo design semplice e la sua portabilità la rendono popolare tra persone di ogni genere.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A go-to bottle widely used for drinks at picnics. Its simple design and portability make it popular among all sorts of people.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ピクニック用の　水筒として　定番の商品。シンプルなデザインで　持ち運びやすく男女問わず　選ぶ人が　多い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "是用于野餐的水壶中较为大众的商品。设计简约，易于携带。无论男女都有很多人会选择它。",
